			"notes": "Probably the biggest IQ update since now, fixed, added, improved, reworked, customized pretty much everything on the mod and also migrating to 26.2 version.\n\n## CHANGES\n→ Fixed Interaction Box from Supply Wapoint being incorrect\n→ Migrated UI render from vanilla to a modern one (this basically improved the GUI & customizations in 1000%, you should check out the new themes)\n→ Completely reworked Pearl Waypoints (ping timers, Kuudra tier, Kuudra Talisman tier and a bunch of new customization options)\n→ Completely reworked Etherwarp Waypoints for Supplies (fully dynamic, with rendering based on crate priority, tracers, and much more)\n→ Moved DPS/SKIP Waypoint to indivual features to Phase 3 - Stun (also added customizations for SKIP waypoints) \n→ Improved Supply Giant Hitbox Alert render and notification \n→ Improved the design and lore of /iq pb and /iq pbs\n→ Improved IQ HUD in a lot of ways but mainly it now helps you align the widgets and cleaner UI\n→ Improved Pile Waypoint Names text, fixed wrong location and added color customization\n→ Added Kuudra Waypoints Screen, allowing you to individually edit, customize, and add waypoints (still W.I.P)\n→ Added Kuudra Profile Viewer showing player stats and gear when someone join through party finder\n→ Added Fire Veil Overlay with configurable countdown widget and alert\n→ Added Placed Supply Efficiency (shows in party chat how fast you placed the supply after picking it up w/ performance ratings msgs)\n→ Added Place Area Hitbox feature in Pile Waypoints config\n→ Added Block Pickobulus (prevents accidentally using Pickobulus outside Eaten/Stun)\n→ Added Attribute Shard Bonus up to 15.6% in Profit Tracker (lava leech/tiamat/komodo)\n→ Added Personal Best info to lifetime/session party commands (!pb)\n→ Added display mode options for Eaten Timer (milliseconds, ticks or seconds) and start mode config\n→ Added an option to hide the default 3/2/1 cannon countdown in Eaten Timer settings\n→ Added more customizable options for Supply Waypoints\n→ Added more customizable options for Kuudra Distance Display\n\n## What's Changed\n* perf(hud): batch config saves added, removing redundant writes. by @mrailouis in https://github.com/iqaddons/IQ/pull/10\n* fix: improve configuration settings by @darkjota1 in https://github.com/iqaddons/IQ/pull/12\n* Ver/1.21.10 by @darkjota1 in https://github.com/iqaddons/IQ/pull/14\n* Update to 26.1.2 by @AlphaMode in https://github.com/iqaddons/IQ/pull/15\n\n## New Contributors\n* @mrailouis made their first contribution in https://github.com/iqaddons/IQ/pull/10\n* @AlphaMode made their first contribution in https://github.com/iqaddons/IQ/pull/15\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/iqaddons/IQ/compare/BETA...RELEASES"
		},
