			"notes": "**IQ Addons** is a Kuudra-focused Quality of Life mod designed to improve gameplay clarity, awareness, and performance during runs on modern Minecraft versions.\n\nThis release marks the first public **BETA** for Minecraft **1.21.10**, bringing the core systems from the legacy 1.8.9 version along with new improvements and redesigned features.\n\n## BETA Status\n\nThis is an early **BETA release.**\nWhile we focused heavily on stability, you may still encounter:\n- bugs\n- inconsistencies\n- unfinished features\n- performance edge cases"
